# Architecture

Next.js fullstack + Prisma + Supabase PostgreSQL. Không tách BE riêng, không dùng Supabase JS.

| Folder | Responsibility |
|---|---|
| `app/` | UI + routing only |
| `actions/` | Mutations: create / update / delete (`"use server"`) |
| `lib/` | Infrastructure + shared helpers (Prisma client, auth, env, fonts) |
| `prisma/` | Database schema + seed |

## Rules

- Reads: query Prisma in Server Components (`app/`), not in client components.
- Writes: go through `actions/`. Do not add `app/api` routes for CRUD.
- Do not add `services/` or `repositories/` layers.
- Import `prisma` only from `@/lib/prisma`. Never instantiate `PrismaClient` in UI.
- Auth session is JWT cookie + bcrypt. Supabase is PostgreSQL host only.
- `proxy.ts` may verify JWT; it must not import Prisma.
